1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:09,754
Listening. Practice test number three. You will hear five tasks. You will hear each recording twice. Get a paper and a pen ready.

2
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:22,187
Task one. You will hear five short dialogues. For each dialogue choose one correct answer A, B, C or D.

3
00:00:23,400 --> 00:00:24,824
Number 1.

4
00:00:35,033 --> 00:00:49,486
[Woman]: Where shall we meet? In front of the cinema? [Man]: There are always too many people in front of the cinema. What about the café opposite? [Woman]: The café is closed today. So let’s meet at the metro, at the exit to the square. [Man]: OK, at the metro at six.

5
00:01:21,567 --> 00:01:22,500
Number 2.

6
00:01:32,700 --> 00:01:46,178
[Woman]: Do you want to try these trousers on? [Man]: I have three pairs of trousers at home. I need something for work, a white shirt. [Woman]: What about this T-shirt? [Man]: No T-shirt, I have to wear a shirt at the office. I’ll take this one.

7
00:02:17,233 --> 00:02:18,233
Number 3.

8
00:02:28,433 --> 00:02:41,632
[Woman]: How much is the flat? [Man]: The rent is fourteen thousand five hundred crowns a month. [Woman]: Is that all-inclusive? [Man]: No, you’ll also pay two thousand for utilities. So sixteen thousand five hundred in total.

9
00:03:12,433 --> 00:03:13,500
Number 4.

10
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:36,588
[Man]: When is your holiday this year? In July as usual? [Woman]: No, I can’t in July this year, my colleague is away. I’ll have my holiday in August. [Man]: Pity, I’m off in September.

11
00:04:07,100 --> 00:04:08,233
Number 5.

12
00:04:18,433 --> 00:04:33,351
[Woman]: Hello, your form is filled in and you have the photo too. Please show me your passport. [Man]: Here it is. [Woman]: Thank you. You still have to pay a fee of one hundred crowns at the cash desk on the second floor. [Man]: OK, I’ll go right away.

13
00:05:05,900 --> 00:05:17,211
Task two. You will hear five short announcements. For each one choose one correct answer A, B, C or D.

14
00:05:18,400 --> 00:05:19,589
Number 6.

15
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:45,132
[Woman]: Dear customers, please note that today is a public holiday and our shop will close at 8 p.m. Normally we are open until 10 p.m. The checkouts will close at 8 p.m. Thank you for your understanding.

16
00:06:18,067 --> 00:06:19,200
Number 7.

17
00:06:29,400 --> 00:06:43,850
[Man]: This weekend the farmers’ market will exceptionally be in the park by the castle, because the road on the square is being repaired. Next week the market will be back on the square. You can buy fruit, vegetables, cheese and honey there.

18
00:07:15,867 --> 00:07:17,095
Number 8.

19
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:44,397
[Woman]: Dear passengers, for technical reasons Florenc station is closed. Metro trains pass through the station without stopping. Passengers for Florenc bus station, please get off at Muzeum or Křižíkova.

20
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,258
Number 9.

21
00:08:30,467 --> 00:08:44,870
[Man]: The new Sparta fitness centre is opening! A single entry costs one hundred crowns. A monthly pass is only nine hundred crowns, seven hundred for students. The first hundred customers get a free T-shirt.

22
00:09:16,867 --> 00:09:18,024
Number 10.

23
00:09:28,233 --> 00:09:43,565
[Woman]: Passengers on flight OK six hundred to London, please go to gate B twelve. Attention, change: not gate B two. Passengers to Paris, please go to gate A five.

24
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:26,208
Task three. You will hear five short texts. For each text choose the correct option A to G. Two options are extra.

25
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,633
Number 11.

26
00:10:35,833 --> 00:10:44,571
[Woman]: I’m Pavla. I used to drive to work, but it was expensive. Now I cycle every day, even when it rains.

27
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:12,129
Number 12.

28
00:11:19,333 --> 00:11:27,374
[Man]: I’m Diego from Spain. I live in Kralupy and work in Prague. I go by train, it’s faster than the bus.

29
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:54,400
Number 13.

30
00:12:01,600 --> 00:12:10,105
[Woman]: I’m Mai. My shop is only five minutes from home, so I walk to work. I don’t have a car and I don’t need one.

31
00:12:36,200 --> 00:12:37,517
Number 14.

32
00:12:44,733 --> 00:12:53,843
[Man]: I’m Bohdan. I live in Prague in Chodov and work in the centre. By tram it takes an hour, so I take the metro.

33
00:13:20,533 --> 00:13:21,833
Number 15.

34
00:13:29,033 --> 00:13:39,629
[Woman]: I’m Aisha. I work as a nurse and I have night shifts. Buses don’t run at night, so I drive to the hospital.

35
00:14:07,833 --> 00:14:17,585
Task four. You will hear five short dialogues. For each dialogue choose the correct picture A to F. One picture is extra.

36
00:14:18,800 --> 00:14:20,284
Number 16.

37
00:14:30,500 --> 00:14:37,969
[Man]: Excuse me, I need to withdraw money. Is there a cash machine here somewhere? [Woman]: Yes, by the main entrance on the right.

38
00:15:03,033 --> 00:15:04,252
Number 17.

39
00:15:14,467 --> 00:15:20,450
[Woman]: Where can I leave my coat and bag? [Man]: The cloakroom is downstairs on the ground floor, next to the stairs.

40
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:45,367
Number 18.

41
00:15:55,567 --> 00:16:01,596
[Man]: Excuse me, where are the toilets here? [Woman]: At the end of the corridor, the second door on the left.

42
00:16:25,233 --> 00:16:26,533
Number 19.

43
00:16:36,733 --> 00:16:43,506
[Woman]: I have a pushchair and I can’t take the stairs. Is there a lift here? [Man]: Yes, right behind the information desk.

44
00:17:07,867 --> 00:17:08,995
Number 20.

45
00:17:19,200 --> 00:17:26,159
[Man]: Where can I buy tickets? [Woman]: The ticket office is next to the entrance, but it only opens at nine.

46
00:17:50,733 --> 00:17:55,373
Task five. You will hear a voice message. Fill in five pieces of information.

47
00:18:06,567 --> 00:18:44,283
[Man]: Hello, Mrs Kovalenková, this is Motor car service. I’m calling about your car. We repaired the brakes and changed the oil. The car will be ready on Thursday. The repair will cost four thousand eight hundred crowns, you can pay by card. We are open until six in the evening. When you come, ask for the mechanic Mr Hrubý. Hrubý is spelled capital H, R, U, B, long Y. If you have any questions, call 608 225 714. Goodbye.

48
00:18:44,767 --> 00:18:46,252
Once more.

49
00:20:07,667 --> 00:20:23,276
This is the end of the test. Count your points. You get one point for each correct answer. You can try the whole exam for free on the Zkouška A2 nanečisto website. The link is in the video description. And subscribe to the channel.
